WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.912
Commissioner Bob Paulson, 2011 to 2017.

00:00:04.862 --> 00:00:10.012
His tenure was defined by the RCMP's systemic harassment crisis.

00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:18.950
The Merlo-Davidson class action settled for 100 million dollars covering over 20,000 current and former female RCMP members.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:24.475
Paulson acknowledged a toxic culture but structural reforms were largely cosmetic.
